{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1256,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4cf996bbc40c1002bd2f48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——\r\n训练的时候我再好好做就是了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9b74f458842c1c1c4774e5430c5a4bf7635451b737e8c7025f3700bc17a6be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc7f5836b5778e7c37510db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要当护花使者吗？\r\n……送到跑道为止，啊这，\r\n诶嘿嘿，决定不了呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9725a3ece5839b201483916a3170ee58bcc52867fb2730c57c48721c510bab44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd311d5a805f24c4db74d54c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，刚才你在看我的脚下对吧？\r\n短筒袜带可是很方便的哦？\r\n好，作为惩罚让你跑十圈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5a8ad914334af10cf6fd50576f2a25b67fa57a37b566aa6d396f7a631d95e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2d22ecba2540066ea9ddc72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将华尔兹的舞步运用于跑步之中……\r\n唔，不太行啊～不，\r\n能不能利用一下节奏感呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc9d661669ec6b7d6baf75ca1005651c0151a714d10359b568fe54a19eec4d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebfd26bd2edd2b2bb022184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在大家面前跳舞啊～\r\n真是大胆呀，啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5d35aefc7e22ae3cdf3aa4ba747633bf3996a097cd1598c4ef3a22165b4cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95fa4ce05b96139aea15efed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，今天的训练内容是？\r\n一切悉听尊便。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49f4fdcf7e050a33009e2fcbaf8dc74feb72ce6b1dd0ba00fb9d0bf544a94d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afb0b7b51b431136f236147",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“我好想休息一下呀～”\r\n……哦呀，不知从哪儿\r\n传来了一声天真无邪的请求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f434866cd8c0ff2f6917fe6d301e03b807b760f374fd139e09bef2d4ec51e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26bea1f1ebbcb54cc48bd355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请让我在训练员的带领下，\r\n变得更加强大吧。\r\n……之后自然就会赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d962ff0ee15c27341a3bb10549da196ff7006963b14c1c7383b6e67cbe420f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e48710431b78bfee79c0d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然能把我培养到这种地步！\r\n真是个好策士呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a691d731a6edf9701da79befccbd9fad6b7095a0f8890df75bec0a1f545b7d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5dd344eb4c2b240f5fcc8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，\r\n看来我好像也挺厉害的嘛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "572f824054086a37bbbded11eb332ff5ce356430be79280605e81b08ad09d180",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:723c94a954dc9d9037e028d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢～……我很开心哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "564e2c850d4e5c7ea0dfb2e5e1d1d535fc5d4cb6b1b9685700508741b41ad2bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd4a8970a7d05ab3175a74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最棒的组合，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "513300e5b3468446ecb05f223ce5e027675527869eb25a99533f7d21926be2ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f81081ee4fca5e4f74f0932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该不会是传说中的成长期吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eee5c019216c576181b5e108a105034c253e3f915eb895a4d2cba765ea0222e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29577a4da27370055f524cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以为这已经……是我的极限？\r\n才不是呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2d19724bb9fcaeb8840c54f44ce9980bb699fed8dbf5aaf846de1b990ba432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48b0de9d2ce86804748d6a36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨嗨——我是青云天空哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1b483128176d458ea998ecc34e781cc01a807733a5e8528e2466bad36c378dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad1d986dca9933403e96d61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要一起来掀起大骚动呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dea1c58f6350e2311ceb2c49956930609f6390cb5d42de34f1cfcfb9067238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76e635d49d7cbc02e8c65df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是打算要去帮忙吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b900e429751e74fee0286f8342ce07cb322fdd8291b3fdd27a9fa412f7fe4711",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa28b9893633c031409e879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇——哦，可以拜托你的意思吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "520067c1b4381fe0bffaf1638c6b6f8d62e0afa5de9fd63b8ed1ae5321d3b5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f302e224c13ed87826645f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说不定我长高了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d441c435137cf6fce47561981c58a0af6d56ef665569e332ec28ff72ff7ae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8552b91a81c6fa92ae4ac80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来一首曲子庆祝一下，怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c834df6838f7cc1a5932ac45b221492da4d32afe69a8f576a0b58347d26ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432a1c2dd93f827b0e67312c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛也好，跳舞也好，\r\n太普通的话就没意思了，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e5b77520a2688da8a43531b9c556511e8d4b2113f0645a15106715f82c708e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93801c613d6664a199e0be9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是青云天空，\r\n需要我当你的护花使者吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80936e0d6ea635f2022a94fd282216d5ce19942c47b744fcf6abe4c0415ac02a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884ad104ef928fb655fb23b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6861a1222a83096c184d05beb9eff554b1a5385a4910b681f3bf859f5335b970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0f23d1316350cf9fd11b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老是顾着往上看，\r\n会忘了重要的事情。也得好好重视\r\n自己的心情才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782fd2297632a44a79eb15fdcdb712a928d060d56cc667b00772650a88e9d0cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02f008f931502c7ecb3e8dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "076958d6edb2f260b21d167257369e37d3898f76a77de1e4241c36926e4d761f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c397e106fb5da3456701b5e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ae3e885116456615ee2bd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还没……还没习惯……！\r\n奖赏自己……！呜～\r\n好讨厌小家子气的自己……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe18662f475f10df5130bf5e550c6b91e0f21dca32c6d21436adc4f212677d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a39c8f32bd9bee63fbb645f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想再吃松饼啊……\r\n好松软啊──呃，不行这样，\r\n我变得跟小栗一样了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af1e598c530ecfc7ef8e9a335bb18f3608897c9cc3eec5637a3772077371b11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef433a2ea62d90e6582cdb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n欸欸，要不要去新年参拜？\r\n去逛逛各家摊贩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "715feea5317c4465a3194e2c88cdc3a77fb5f2bc7218fa74e2fc5b3c9580e408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b685acfe8d88fbcc40b5b2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到了一堆巧克力！\r\n身边的人真的都对我很好。\r\n大家都好温柔，心里暖烘烘的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf10653e82fe1c359578fc5ef1790f11111c2f63f2379d7915bf169a118f4bcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c3fef3f5e449e07425b6884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我独家特制的饼干，加了\r\n营养丰富的豆渣！……外观虽然\r\n不好看但很好吃喔。真、真的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65c04d8613ea745c0d27b72e70a8ccfb6e517331f4b0f1023fc1fec7df404881",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ccbd36e4eb355cc795ed9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请让我再长高一点──\r\n唔哇！？你在啊！刚刚我说的\r\n是那个啦！就那个啊……那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a4d63fae3ed7e264de7303ffc2eb2946431f1382c32ae063586fc4607e5b854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21374762912c4afde48ff106",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摆了好多南瓜……\r\n不能带一个回去吗……？\r\n……应该可以吃一个礼拜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7e18ff45c1ee613cd6f97adaf05b4dca96e8b41467d181a16c57ff0025af13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03a3d89cd6eae996254b852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小不点们今天应该\r\n津津有味地吃着鸡肉饭吧～\r\n嘿嘿，害我也突然想吃了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16dcf2eed2c7e26e9a302d0b0c6fe79481147dc1aec9f4ee7b8d75bc7e91a4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d00eaa7ce40432d279c5da9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好喔，圣诞节！\r\n大家看起来都很开心享受……\r\n是说，你的表情也都松懈下来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce97d6258fd12e7bdd9a60c48e4ad59fd985597d8096b8b64f48f1086587928",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08e4620172d916793aeebef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61001b03d3bd62444b0e3108412891d24ae8c73521b01502f1ef914bf0928b70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3acb8f7d729ecbe72cdd903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除结束了吗？有扫干净吗？\r\n可不能积灰尘喔！\r\n要以清爽的心情迎接新年！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea5e4f0c0c5e1be7e856ecd08bc78f50412cb36af99c604b214eb62bcf6f87a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652821b134ac546b5d87f121",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去食堂吧！\r\n我想稍微努力，做个蛋糕看看！\r\n来盛大地帮你庆生吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a0d15f4334b55dde0b1e2fb8e10a8163a8d6993612e2b3f6253f80efd7584f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bb0b4c4d04af60a85ded8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没办法送你贵重的东西……\r\n不过！至少我有时间！\r\n今天要我陪你几小时都可以！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d065626dbf62d71fc9ddacbfe1015c221fffc144630df67f84b9f41d7a64179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7932f2974a8d1a19c947e2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为过了生日，今年可以更加\r\n成长──你在笑什么！\r\n我刚刚说的是……精神层面啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9e8932ea1621f6f0eb9e0ca8b71e2fb85131080bf7c66b3ddb58c250706cfc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788ba01b2d0740f05b59f255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物！？可以收下吗！？\r\n不好意思啊……！但我好开心！\r\n下次那个……我会送你回礼的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "749a2403acd00b56ab3e94b02c5c2db574be489843403883658dbd011f833d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa34c5f0f170a57b5f5e3d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说有新的公告！\r\n不看就亏大咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca802bd41332b3fff3ab0d1018e8c3ac25db750c28a9b62010b2afc83a8b427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c39cfbb48b73c98e5ef3476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物！太幸运了吧！\r\n你要赶快去领！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22f9e8fb618de52feabf484e9c42b34dc72cedc3524a618a94f15463fbac2f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c727b2aaba5d78c54e385a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务，辛苦了！\r\n要休息吗？给你吃糖吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abc294e945cdf435586291cb7b1b95f9b165f25ac999b5e13c81ee5d2df727a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff2d57f7e7be16a6f1fbde7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像快开始了！\r\n事不宜迟，现在就开始准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d273926a75bd8dd0a2bfdd787954b3a13d4334a677dcc0fb92f150629ad27123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997f4695e34843b970fb6bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动举办中！\r\n会有参加奖吗？\r\n总之我们快去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1990b2e1bb225597da254f8b6b68796cd2c78eb2dc134690f80f1390a3f1ef4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eaa7b213d4de1fe30e3b27d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c036f562c6a75a4e27815cd5424c55f5a4bd1b97d2360e4bee2da178142a3654",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a484c85cf0c26b328dd7d9e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级提升咯！\r\n……能获得什么奖赏吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf3edf5bca798eeb354b44bdd0bd27c90087484da2d164941b2865693a5eaec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d537fa6ce69c25d8015bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服、バーゲンで掴み取りして\r\nきたにしては似合っとるやろ？\r\nちょお…っと大きいけどな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd56e02f6cb0063690298881de00e1d03639494e323cfd41699692b97d1922f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ecb5a94d09f90502841118e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このシャツこないだオグリに\r\n貸したらサイズぴったしでな…\r\nわかっとったけど複雑やわ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddd74ba40a710a8553645a6f5ba94364b18aa7280b5f8d816ddff7e3ee025722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fba1b50788f8b20ab5dff78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチの服はその内おさがりで\r\nチビたちも着ることになるからな～\r\n手入れは結構ちゃんとしてんで？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c58e9def8514cc505a50f143e8c1c92d96ff06e2d4d5af2b2fb2061e6df04d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ab09f0a84ee2813e1f77d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没办法了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae7c54881857d6af64c643a7dfabec4bf50cd136d1ed9c3eda1b346f9a4b877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
